# OxiMail antivirus — built-in signature set.
#
# Format: <sha256-hex>:<signature-name>
# Comments (#) and blank lines are skipped.
#
# Embedded into the oximail binary via //go:embed so a fresh build
# is virus-aware on the EICAR test signature without any external
# database. Operators can layer additional hashes by setting
# OXIMAIL_AV_SIGDB to a file path; the contents are loaded
# alongside this builtin set.

275a021bbfb6489e54d471899f7db9d1663fc695ec2fe2a2c4538aabf651fd0f:EICAR-Test-File
